{
  "slug": "databases-on-aws",
  "name": "Databases On Aws",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Expert database guidance for the AWS database portfolio. Design schemas, execute queries, handle migrations, and choose the right database for your workload.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 hook** and **3 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `dsql` (Build with Aurora DSQL — manage schemas, execute queries, handle migrations, diagnose query plans, diagnose cluster performance, load…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (3): `awsknowledge`, `aurora-dsql`, `cloudwatch`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install databases-on-aws@claude-plugins-official` from `awslabs/agent-plugins` (`plugins/databases-on-aws`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
